{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:52 2026-10-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:52 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:52 2026-10-17 HKT</p><img alt=\"小欖院舍70歲翁疑食糊仔鯁喉 送院搶救不治。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/99f181c60e4ac7585cee85db18956677/2026-10/ha_tuen.jpg\"/><p>屯門小欖康輝路一院舍，今日（10月17日）下午5時許職員報案，指一名70歲姓姚老翁進食糊仔時，懷疑鯁喉暈倒。救護員接報趕至，將老翁送往屯門醫院，可惜最終搶救無效不治。老翁確實死因仍待驗屍後確定。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T14:59:12.441588+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:52:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T04:57:51.633257+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:57:36.610930+00:00","content_hash":"36b56cb5eb0cc503ce821691682033c1c17e72038411ec26b947d7f30a629fa7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}